es":[{"en":"Fedora","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<td><strong>x86_64</strong></td>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<td>ovmf</td>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<td>edk2-ovmf</td>","sentences":[{"en":"edk2-ovmf","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<td>edk2-ovmf</td>","sentences":[{"en":"edk2-ovmf","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<td><strong>aarch64</strong></td>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<td>qemu-efi-aarch64</td>","sentences":[{"en":"qemu-efi-aarch64","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<td>edk2-aarch64</td>","sentences":[{"en":"edk2-aarch64","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<td>edk2-aarch64</td>","sentences":[{"en":"edk2-aarch64","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<td><strong>riscv64</strong></td>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<td>qemu-efi-riscv64</td>","sentences":[{"en":"qemu-efi-riscv64","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<td>edk2-riscv64</td>","sentences":[{"en":"edk2-riscv64","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">Installation</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Installation","zh":"安装"}]},{"html_en":"<h3 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">Binary release</h3>","sentences":[{"en":"Binary release","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p dir=\"auto\">You can download the pre-built binaries from the release page <a href=\"https://github.com/pythops/kudu/releases\">release page</a></p>","sentences":[{"en":"You can download the pre-built binaries from the release page release page","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h3 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">Build from source</h3>","sentences":[{"en":"Build from source","zh":"从源代码构建"}]},{"html_en":"<h3 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">On Arch Linux</h3>","sentences":[{"en":"On Arch Linux","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">Usage</h2>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">FAQ</h2>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<h5 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">Q: KVM shows Disabled or Unavailable.</h5>","sentences":[{"en":"Q: KVM shows Disabled or Unavailable.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p dir=\"auto\">Make sure the <code>kvm</code> kernel module is loaded if you have Intel/AMD processor.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Make sure the kvm kernel module is loaded if you have Intel/AMD processor.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p dir=\"auto\">if you run <code>kudu</code> as regular user, make sure your user belongs to <code>kvm</code> group. otherwise run <code>kudu</code> with sudo.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"if you run kudu as regular user, make sure your user belongs to kvm group.","zh":null},{"en":"otherwise run kudu with sudo.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p dir=\"auto\"><code>kudu</code> still runs fine even if kvm is not available.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"kudu still runs fine even if kvm is not available.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">Contributing</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Contributing","zh":"贡献"}]},{"html_en":"<li>Strict No LLM.</li>","sentences":[{"en":"Strict No LLM.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<li>Only submit a PR after having a prior issue or discussion.</li>","sentences":[{"en":"Only submit a PR after having a prior issue or discussion.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<li>Keep PRs small and focused.</li>","sentences":[{"en":"Keep PRs small and focused.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">License</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"License","zh":"执照"}]},{"html_en":"<p dir=\"auto\">GPLv3</p>","sentences":[]}],"translated":true,"content_html_zh":"<div class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div data-hpc=\"true\" containertiming=\"hpc\"><article itemprop=\"text\">\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/57548585/637510279-2331028e-741c-4689-9777-fb74fd72b345.gif?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..NpPfTghQxftolxUg7BFvajalL12OT-u5AhcbFbYDebo\"><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/57548585/637510279-2331028e-741c-4689-9777-fb74fd72b345.gif?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..NpPfTghQxftolxUg7BFvajalL12OT-u5AhcbFbYDebo\" alt=\"\" data-animated-image=\"\"></a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"></p><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">描述</h2><a id=\"user-content-description\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Description\" href=\"#description\"></a><p></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">kudu is a TUI for creating and managing VMs on Linux. It is an alternative to GUIs like virt-manager or GNOME boxes and as opposed to these, it does not rely on libvirt</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"></p><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">先决条件</h2><a id=\"user-content-prerequisites\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Prerequisites\" href=\"#prerequisites\"></a><p></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>A Linux based OS.</li>\n<li>qemu binaries, at least one of those: qemu-system-x86 qemu-system-aarch64 qemu-system-riscv</li>\n<li>xorriso for cloudinit</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code>passt</code></p>\n</li>\n<li>uefi firmware package (Optional for x86_64) Debian/Ubuntu Arch (btw) Fedora x86_64 ovmf edk2-ovmf edk2-ovmf aarch64 qemu-efi-aarch64 edk2-aarch64 edk2-aarch64 riscv64 qemu-efi-riscv64 edk2-riscv64 -</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"></p><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">安装</h2><a id=\"user-content-installation\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Installation\" href=\"#installation\"></a><p></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"></p><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">Binary release</h3><a id=\"user-content-binary-release\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Binary release\" href=\"#binary-release\"></a><p></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">You can download the pre-built binaries from the release page release page</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"></p><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">从源代码构建</h3><a id=\"user-content-build-from-source\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Build from source\" href=\"#build-from-source\"></a><p></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"git clone https://github.com/pythops/kudu\ncd kudu\ncargo build --release\"><pre>git clone https://github.com/pythops/kudu\n<span>cd</span> kudu\ncargo build --release</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"></p><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">On Arch Linux</h3><a id=\"user-content-on-arch-linux\" aria-label=\"Permalink: On Arch Linux\" href=\"#on-arch-linux\"></a><p></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"pacman -S kudu\"><pre>pacman -S kudu</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"></p><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">Usage</h2><a id=\"user-content-usage\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Usage\" href=\"#usage\"></a><p></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"$ kudu\"><pre>$ kudu</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"></p><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">FAQ</h2><a id=\"user-content-faq\" aria-label=\"Permalink: FAQ\" href=\"#faq\"></a><p></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"></p><h5 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">Q: KVM shows Disabled or Unavailable.</h5><a id=\"user-content-q-kvm-shows-disabled-or-unavailable\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Q: KVM shows Disabled or Unavailable.\" href=\"#q-kvm-shows-disabled-or-unavailable\"></a><p></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Make sure the kvm kernel module is loaded if you have Intel/AMD processor.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">if you run kudu as regular user, make sure your user belongs to kvm group. otherwise run kudu with sudo.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">kudu still runs fine even if kvm is not available.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"></p><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">贡献</h2><a id=\"user-content-contributing\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Contributing\" href=\"#contributing\"></a><p></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Strict No LLM.</li>\n<li>Only submit a PR after having a prior issue or discussion.</li>\n<li>Keep PRs small and focused.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"></p><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">执照</h2><a id=\"user-content-license\" aria-label=\"Permalink: License\" href=\"#license\"></a><p></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">GPLv3</p>\n</article></div></div>"}